# Local state (never commit raw cloud data -- section 176)
# `*` (not `/`) keeps the dir itself un-excluded so fixtures can re-include a
# committed `case.yaml` — SDD fixtures need a live case store to gate-test
# `case_missing` (operator define binds to an open case).
.sparkforge-azure/*
.sparkforge-azure/journal.jsonl
!fixtures/**/.sparkforge-azure/case.yaml
*.raw.json
.env
.env.*

# AgentSpec-era local harness state (superseded by sparkforge_azure/sdd; SDD_MIGRATION)
.claude/sdd/
# `.claude/agents/custom/` carries generated host mirrors — tracked like
# `.agents/agents/` (README describes the layout; `agents sync` renders it).
.claude/agents/*
!.claude/agents/README.md
!.claude/agents/custom/

